I sit at Marine Drive for some time.
The sea here is very beautiful.
Now I want to go home.
I stand up.
I walk towards the main road.
This time I do not ask anyone the way.
I know the return road.
First I go straight.
Then I turn left.
The bus stop is ahead.
I go towards the bus stop.
After a short while, my bus comes.
I board the bus.
I sit near the window.
The road outside feels familiar now.
I understand the roads of South Mumbai now.
I feel very proud of myself.
I go to my home happily.
